            "review_text": "doctor4848\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nCheated and meaningless slogan.\nJul 2016 • Family\nThe slogan \"Free 100% on bill, if the first dish is served after 20'\" is cheated and meaning less. \nFirst, they served the 3 dishes in 15' and then 3 remaining after 30'. The staff told us : Do not complain, It's ok, read carefully the slogan other there, we are right !!!\nA lot of fly every where. Raw meat. Worst pho. The servers are deaf and always make mistaken order. \nNever come back again. Bye bye forever.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 16, 2016",
